WEBVTT

00:01.270 --> 00:06.530
<b>Satoshi, Pikachu, Kasumi and Takeshi 
 continue their aimless, free journey.</b>

00:06.530 --> 00:09.490
<b>They have arrived 
 at a certain port town.</b>

00:09.990 --> 00:12.080
<b>What a big town!</b>

00:12.830 --> 00:15.620
<b>Looks like we’ll get to relax 
 at a Pokémon Center today.</b>

00:15.620 --> 00:19.120
<b>We need to restock 
 on Potions and food, too.</b>

00:20.380 --> 00:23.290
<b>Konpang! Konpang! 
 Over here!</b>

00:26.260 --> 00:27.800
<b>Caught me off guard...</b>

00:27.800 --> 00:30.930
<b>Haven’t gotten better at dealing with 
 Bug Pokémon, huh?</b>

00:30.930 --> 00:34.310
<b>Ooh, a Hariteyama and a Bakuuda!</b>

00:34.310 --> 00:36.980
<b>Hey! Do your best!</b>

00:38.480 --> 00:39.890
<b>Hurry! Hurry!</b>

00:39.890 --> 00:41.770
<b>The show’s not going anywhere!</b>

00:41.770 --> 00:42.900
<b>Show?</b>

00:51.820 --> 00:53.910
<b>Hey, look!</b>

00:56.160 --> 00:57.700
<b>Zenigame!</b>

