02:37.300 --> 02:40.010
<b>“The Zenigame Fire Squad Show”...</b>

02:40.810 --> 02:44.640
<b>Once upon a time, in his travels with his friends, 
 Satoshi caught Zenigame.</b>

02:45.730 --> 02:48.480
<b>It now serves as leader of 
 the Zenigame Fire Squad,</b>

02:48.480 --> 02:53.740
<b>and takes part in “Fire Chief for a Day” events 
 and disaster prevention drills in different towns.</b>

02:54.860 --> 02:57.200
<b>That’s right, 
 I’ve heard it’s really popular.{Resembles NEP}</b>

02:57.200 --> 02:59.700
<b>Wow... 
 Must be working really hard!</b>

03:01.540 --> 03:03.160
<b>I wanna go see it, too!{Likewise, I also want to meet Zenigame, Pikachu}</b>

03:03.160 --> 03:06.250
<b>Oh yeah, 
 these two gotta know, too.</b>

03:06.250 --> 03:07.630
<b>Come on out!</b>

03:14.130 --> 03:17.300
<b>Fushigidane, Lizardon, look!</b>

03:21.140 --> 03:23.270
<b>It’s been forever, hasn’t it?</b>

03:23.270 --> 03:25.640
<b>Let’s go cheer 
 for Zenigame together!{Resembles NEP}</b>

03:28.020 --> 03:29.980
<b>These guys are so famous.</b>

03:30.360 --> 03:36.150
<b>We made the right choice forcing our way into being 
 their managers once we realized how popular they are.</b>

03:36.150 --> 03:40.490
<b>We get to sell lots of tie-in merch 
 and rake in the dough, meow!</b>

03:42.540 --> 03:46.500
<b>Don’t be shy! How about some 
 Zenigame Fire Squad pep merch?</b>

03:46.500 --> 03:49.380
<b>We have pin badges, portraits, 
 and posters, too!</b>

03:49.380 --> 03:51.040
<b>Excuse me!</b>

03:51.040 --> 03:52.670
<b>Yes?</b>

03:52.670 --> 03:54.260
<b>The brat boy!</b>

03:54.260 --> 03:56.260
<b>What sort of pep merch 
 do you have?</b>

03:56.800 --> 04:01.220
<b>O-Of course, we have exclusive fans, 
 glow sticks, cheering costumes, and more, haha...</b>

04:01.220 --> 04:02.510
<b>Ooh...</b>

04:05.140 --> 04:07.560
<b>That looks great on you, Pikachu!</b>

04:12.020 --> 04:13.400
<b>It’s starting!</b>

04:15.110 --> 04:17.400
<b>Ah-hah, hah, and more hah!</b>

04:17.780 --> 04:18.910
<b>What’s this?</b>

04:20.030 --> 04:22.160
<b>If you ask us “What’s this?”, “Pika?”...</b>

04:22.160 --> 04:24.290
<b>We’ll tell you out of 
 sympathy for the world!</b>

04:24.660 --> 04:26.790
<b>To prevent fire safety!</b>

04:26.790 --> 04:29.290
<b>To preserve the world’s {conflagrations}infernos!{Google results show this could also mean the opposite, but feels like this is the right take if they're siding with the fires}</b>

04:29.290 --> 04:32.040
<b>Championing the evils of fire and smoke!</b>

04:32.040 --> 04:34.800
<b>We’re the burning, 
 hot-hot-hot villains!</b>

04:34.800 --> 04:36.420
<b>Musafire!</b>

04:36.420 --> 04:38.050
<b>Kojiflame...</b>

04:38.050 --> 04:42.050
<b>The Team Blaze duo 
 races through scenes of fires{sites of fires}!</b>

04:42.050 --> 04:46.430
<b>Like complete combustion, 
 a burnt-out tomorrow awaits us!</b>

04:46.430 --> 04:48.180
<b>Just kidding, meow...</b>

04:50.230 --> 04:51.480
<b>Team Blaze?</b>

04:51.480 --> 04:54.070
<b>I feel like I’ve seen them 
 somewhere before...</b>

04:54.070 --> 04:56.980
<b>Hey, hey, 
 we’re gonna start a fire!</b>

04:56.980 --> 04:58.440
<b>Ready, set...</b>

04:58.440 --> 05:00.490
<b><i>Blaze!</i></b>

05:04.450 --> 05:06.700
<b>Ah-hah, hah, and more hah!</b>

05:20.260 --> 05:21.550
<b>It’s really them!</b>

05:21.550 --> 05:22.640
<b>So cool!</b>

05:22.640 --> 05:24.140
<b>Zenigame!</b>

05:24.470 --> 05:27.140
<b>So you show yourself, 
 Zenigame Fire Squad!</b>

05:35.520 --> 05:37.070
<b>You can do it!</b>

05:37.070 --> 05:38.280
<b>Zenigame Fire Squad!</b>

05:39.440 --> 05:41.150
<b>Good job, Zenigame!</b>

05:56.920 --> 06:01.130
<b>Eep! We give up! 
 Team Blaze surrenders!</b>

06:01.130 --> 06:03.930
<b>We’ll never do evil ever again!</b>

06:03.930 --> 06:05.760
<b>Just kidding, meow!</b>

06:14.190 --> 06:16.190
<b>They’re incredible!</b>

06:16.190 --> 06:19.570
<b>They seem more like 
 heroes of justice than a fire squad.</b>

06:21.440 --> 06:25.070
<b>There you have it! 
 The Zenigame Fire Squad were cool, huh?</b>

06:25.070 --> 06:28.030
<b>Next, we have handshake sessions 
 and photo shoots!</b>

06:28.030 --> 06:29.830
<b>Don’t forget to buy your tickets!</b>

06:29.830 --> 06:32.830
<b>Okay! Line up, line up!</b>

06:32.830 --> 06:34.330
<b>We should go, too!</b>

06:34.330 --> 06:35.000
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:41.050 --> 06:42.630
<b>Zenigame, cutie!</b>

06:42.630 --> 06:44.050
<b>Shake my hand!</b>

06:53.020 --> 06:55.100
<b>The merch sold out in moments, too!</b>

06:55.100 --> 06:56.560
<b>Then all that’s left is...</b>

06:56.560 --> 06:59.570
<b>...getting out of here quick 
 and having a good meal, meow!</b>

06:59.570 --> 07:02.610
<b>All right! Today’s handshake sessions 
 have now concluded!</b>

07:02.610 --> 07:03.940
<b><i>Whaaa—?</i></b>

07:03.940 --> 07:07.700
<b>That Zenigame’s a friend of ours! 
 Couldn’t we just have a moment...?</b>

07:07.700 --> 07:12.330
<b>No, no! After this, they’re heading back 
 to that hotel and have lots to do,</b>

07:12.330 --> 07:14.580
<b>so off you go, off you go.</b>

07:15.040 --> 07:17.960
<b>They must be busy, 
 being so popular.</b>

07:17.960 --> 07:20.040
<b>We really wanted to say hi...</b>

07:23.510 --> 07:24.050
<b>Thank you!</b>

07:24.050 --> 07:25.470
<b>Thank you.</b>

07:40.440 --> 07:43.400
<b>My! Your show was 
 a big success again today!</b>

07:43.940 --> 07:46.650
<b>{Amazing}Making us proud, 
 Zenigame of the Zenigame Fire Squad!{Sasuga. line}</b>

07:46.650 --> 07:50.490
<b>The perks of having 
 good managers, am I right?</b>

07:52.410 --> 07:55.710
<b>Hey, hey! 
 Keep the food and drinks coming!</b>

07:55.710 --> 07:58.290
<b>Goes without saying, 
 but bring us more, too, meow!</b>

08:06.800 --> 08:09.590
<b>Hey... That one 
 doesn’t look happy, does it?</b>

08:09.590 --> 08:11.260
<b>It’s not sick or something, is it?</b>

08:18.440 --> 08:22.310
<b>It said, “Am I not 
 your friend anymore?”, meow.</b>

08:22.310 --> 08:23.980
<b>Huh? What’s that mean?</b>

08:23.980 --> 08:24.940
<b>Beats me...</b>

08:32.240 --> 08:35.750
<b>Oh! That hotel! 
 The Zenigame might be in there.</b>

08:35.750 --> 08:37.460
<b>Why don’t we have a quick look?</b>

08:37.460 --> 08:38.040
<b>Let’s.</b>

09:17.540 --> 09:20.370
<b>Wow! It’s gorgeous!</b>

09:20.830 --> 09:23.130
<b>I wonder where the Zenigame are...</b>

09:26.130 --> 09:29.880
<b>What a racket... 
 What’s going on?</b>

09:29.880 --> 09:32.430
<b>It’s the brat boys again, meow.</b>

09:32.430 --> 09:36.180
<b>Don’t tell me they’re here 
 to take Zenigame back...</b>

09:36.890 --> 09:38.390
<b>That’s not funny!</b>

09:39.730 --> 09:41.270
<b>Oh, over there!</b>

09:42.600 --> 09:43.980
<b>I’m very sorry!</b>

09:43.980 --> 09:46.480
<b>No one’s allowed past here!</b>

09:46.480 --> 09:47.440
<b>Huh?</b>

09:47.440 --> 09:49.860
<b>All we want is to 
 talk to Zenigame.</b>

09:49.860 --> 09:51.530
<b>We’re its friends.</b>

09:51.530 --> 09:52.780
<b>N-O!</b>

10:27.900 --> 10:29.570
<b>Hold on a sec!</b>

10:35.910 --> 10:39.290
<b>Wh-What are you fighting for?! 
 Calm down!</b>

10:39.950 --> 10:42.290
<b>Don’t be like this 
 when we haven’t met in so long!</b>

10:42.290 --> 10:43.830
<b>Okay, Zenigame?</b>

10:44.710 --> 10:46.290
<b>Zenigame...</b>

10:46.290 --> 10:48.420
<b>What’s happened to you?</b>

10:53.800 --> 10:56.180
<b>H-Hey, Pikachu!, stop! 
 Not you, too!</b>

10:56.680 --> 10:57.550
<b>Satoshi!</b>

10:57.550 --> 10:59.050
<b>We told you, no entry!</b>

11:08.560 --> 11:12.440
<b>Wh— Hey! Wait! 
 Lizardon! Fushigidane!</b>

11:14.030 --> 11:15.860
<b>Hey, Zenigame...</b>

11:16.860 --> 11:18.120
<b>Zenigame...</b>

11:18.120 --> 11:20.330
<b>They’re getting away.</b>

11:20.330 --> 11:21.910
<b>R-Right...</b>

11:34.010 --> 11:35.340
<b>What was that about?</b>

11:35.340 --> 11:38.180
<b>Hey, couldn’t this be our chance?</b>

11:38.180 --> 11:40.760
<b>Pikachu and pals 
 are vulnerable, meow.</b>

11:43.140 --> 11:44.730
<b>That’s a good point.</b>

