11:52.610 --> 11:57.530
<b>Zenigame</b>

11:52.610 --> 11:57.530
<b>Zenigame</b>

11:52.610 --> 11:57.530
<b>Water</b>

11:52.610 --> 11:57.530
<b>m 0 0 m 1575 960 l 1830 960 l 1830 1024.5 l 1575 1024.5</b>

12:04.540 --> 12:07.370
<b>They were cheering 
 for it earlier...</b>

12:07.370 --> 12:10.000
<b>What made them fight?</b>

12:10.000 --> 12:11.880
<b>I don’t know...</b>

12:11.880 --> 12:15.050
<b>Zenigame seemed stubborn 
 for some reason, too.</b>

12:15.050 --> 12:19.260
<b>Hey, Lizardon, Fushigidane... 
 Cheer up.</b>

12:19.260 --> 12:21.430
<b>You should make up with Zenigame.</b>

12:23.350 --> 12:26.310
<b>We’re all friends 
 who traveled together...</b>

12:47.910 --> 12:50.330
<b>This could have been 
 a heartfelt reunion...</b>

12:51.750 --> 12:54.040
<b>They don’t suspect anything... 
 Not a thing...</b>

12:54.040 --> 12:56.340
<b>On top of making lots of money 
 with Zenigame...</b>

12:56.340 --> 12:59.550
<b>...we can catch Pikachu 
 and laugh like kings, meow!</b>

12:59.550 --> 13:01.640
<b>Fire!</b>

13:23.410 --> 13:26.870
<b><i>What an awful feeling!</i></b>

13:37.590 --> 13:41.880
<b><i>What an awful feeling: 
 part two!</i></b>

13:50.180 --> 13:53.770
<b>When you realized Konpang was gone, 
 where were you?</b>

13:54.650 --> 13:57.150
<b>It was when I was crossing 
 that intersection...</b>

13:57.150 --> 14:00.030
<b>Understood. 
 I’ll see if I can find it.</b>

14:00.030 --> 14:03.410
<b>Ms. Junsa! 
 Is something wrong?</b>

14:03.410 --> 14:05.620
<b>Yes... 
 A Pokémon is missing.</b>

14:05.950 --> 14:08.490
<b>Let me accompany you 
 in your search.</b>

14:08.490 --> 14:10.700
<b>Huh? N-No, I’ll be fine.</b>

14:10.700 --> 14:12.330
<b>Don’t be shy!</b>

14:12.330 --> 14:14.830
<b>Meeting like this... 
 could only be fate!</b>

14:14.830 --> 14:18.340
<b>For you, 
 be it fire, water—</b>

14:18.670 --> 14:21.970
<b>Okay, okay... Don’t bother her 
 while she’s working...</b>

14:21.970 --> 14:25.180
<b>Double the straight men, 
 double the punishment...</b>

14:37.440 --> 14:40.190
<b>Thank you for your cooperation.</b>

14:40.190 --> 14:41.780
<b>Look! It’s a fire!</b>

14:41.780 --> 14:43.700
<b>Isn’t that the 
 warehouse district?!</b>

14:43.700 --> 14:45.030
<b>Oh, no!</b>

14:46.910 --> 14:48.830
<b>What’s all this noise about?</b>

14:48.830 --> 14:50.580
<b>Hey, what’s that smoke?</b>

14:51.790 --> 14:53.250
<b>It’s a fire!</b>

14:53.250 --> 14:54.290
<b>Are you okay?</b>

14:57.500 --> 14:59.670
<b>What’s happened to you?</b>

15:06.010 --> 15:07.970
<b>Seems the fire started 
 in the warehouse district!</b>

15:07.970 --> 15:09.100
<b>This is bad...</b>

15:09.100 --> 15:11.100
<b>We need to get the guests to safety!</b>

15:25.490 --> 15:27.610
<b>It’s the Zenigame Fire Squad!</b>

15:48.760 --> 15:51.890
<b>You can do it, 
 Zenigame Fire Squad!</b>

15:51.890 --> 15:53.100
<b>Zenigame!</b>

15:53.970 --> 15:56.940
<b>Stand back! 
 Keep away from the warehouse!</b>

15:56.940 --> 15:59.440
<b>I’ll help you 
 with the evacuation!</b>

15:59.440 --> 16:00.150
<b>Thank you.</b>

16:00.690 --> 16:03.690
<b>Everyone! Stand back!</b>

16:03.690 --> 16:05.530
<b>We should help Zenigame!</b>

16:05.530 --> 16:06.280
<b>Got it!</b>

16:06.280 --> 16:08.450
<b>Fushigidane! Lizardon!</b>

16:11.990 --> 16:13.990
<b>Pikachu, let’s go!</b>

16:14.410 --> 16:15.330
<b>You’re up!</b>

16:18.870 --> 16:20.420
<b>Help us put out the fire!</b>

16:20.420 --> 16:24.630
<b>Koduck, Udeppou, use Water Gun! 
 Nyorotono, use Hydro Pump!</b>

16:35.020 --> 16:37.060
<b>Don’t give up, Zenigame!</b>

16:40.020 --> 16:42.060
<b>I know you guys 
 can put this out!</b>

16:42.060 --> 16:44.270
<b>A leader can’t stumble 
 when it counts!</b>

17:24.770 --> 17:26.730
<b>Whoa, awesome!</b>

17:26.730 --> 17:30.200
<b>Kasumi, connect this 
 to the water main, please.</b>

17:30.200 --> 17:31.320
<b>Okay!</b>

17:40.870 --> 17:42.500
<b>Thanks, Pikachu!</b>

17:48.260 --> 17:49.260
<b>Oh, no!</b>

17:50.050 --> 17:51.550
<b>Satoshi! Over there!</b>

17:51.550 --> 17:53.390
<b>Put it out before it spreads!</b>

18:01.730 --> 18:04.150
<b>Go out! 
 Please go out!</b>

18:12.200 --> 18:13.410
<b>Fushigidane!</b>

18:16.870 --> 18:18.870
<b>Lizardon!</b>

18:35.390 --> 18:37.680
<b>You’ve almost got it!</b>

18:37.680 --> 18:39.890
<b>There’s Pokémon up there!</b>

18:43.020 --> 18:44.140
<b>Konpang!</b>

18:44.140 --> 18:46.020
<b>Not good... Lizardon!</b>

18:47.900 --> 18:49.860
<b>Zenigame, Fushigidane, 
 you come, too!</b>

18:53.280 --> 18:54.860
<b>Counting on you!</b>

18:54.860 --> 18:56.780
<b>Get as close as you can!</b>

18:57.820 --> 18:59.580
<b>Zenigame, use Water Gun!</b>

19:03.540 --> 19:06.880
<b>Fushigidane, use Vine Whip 
 to rescue Konpang and the others!</b>

19:14.760 --> 19:16.970
<b>All right! Good work!</b>

19:19.810 --> 19:21.520
<b>Hey, could that be...?</b>

19:21.520 --> 19:23.310
<b>Y-Yeah!</b>

19:33.440 --> 19:35.280
<b>We did it!</b>

19:35.280 --> 19:37.070
<b>You’re incredible, Zenigame!</b>

19:52.590 --> 19:55.970
<b>We never did find out 
 why they were fighting.</b>

19:55.970 --> 20:00.050
<b>Well, they’ve made up now, 
 so all’s well that ends well.</b>

20:08.310 --> 20:11.020
<b>What a relief. 
 There you are!</b>

20:11.980 --> 20:15.110
<b>Double the Ms. Junsas, 
 double the joy!</b>

20:16.070 --> 20:20.320
<b>So then, those managers 
 took the Zenigame Fire Squad without telling you?</b>

20:20.320 --> 20:23.450
<b>Yes. I’m glad I finally 
 found them again.</b>

20:23.450 --> 20:26.910
<b>Allow me to donate 
 the merch proceeds to this town.</b>

20:26.910 --> 20:30.670
<b>I appreciate it. 
 They’ll be used to rebuild the warehouse.</b>

20:33.250 --> 20:36.340
<b>Zenigame, you’re heading 
 to the next town, huh?</b>

20:37.340 --> 20:40.840
<b>They have lots of people 
 waiting for them.</b>

20:41.340 --> 20:44.100
<b>Do your best, 
Zenigame Fire Squad!</b>

20:50.400 --> 20:53.980
<b>Zenigame! 
 Let’s battle together again sometime!</b>

21:07.370 --> 21:09.250
<b>Hey!</b>

21:09.250 --> 21:09.830
<b>Whoa!</b>

21:09.830 --> 21:11.500
<b>Wait!</b>

21:12.080 --> 21:13.710
<b>Zenigame’s fans?</b>

21:13.710 --> 21:14.920
<b>They really are famous.{Sasuga. line}</b>

21:14.920 --> 21:17.760
<b>I was right! 
 It’s Champion Satoshi!</b>

21:17.760 --> 21:19.010
<b>Sign this!</b>

21:19.010 --> 21:20.630
<b>Let me take a photo!</b>

21:20.630 --> 21:22.390
<b>Huh? Me?</b>

21:23.390 --> 21:25.350
<b>Guess we had a famous face 
 in our midst, too.</b>

21:25.760 --> 21:26.850
<b>Shake my hand!</b>

21:26.850 --> 21:28.350
<b>Let me hug Pikachu!</b>

21:28.350 --> 21:29.810
<b>Ms. Kasumi! Mr. Takeshi!</b>

21:29.810 --> 21:31.230
<b>I’m popular!</b>

21:31.230 --> 21:35.730
<b>Bidding the Zenigame Fire Squad farewell, 
 Satoshi and friends set off once again.</b>

21:35.730 --> 21:39.860
<b>What sort of Pokémon 
 and adventures await them?</b>

21:48.700 --> 21:50.290
How many friends?

21:48.700 --> 21:50.290
How many friends?

21:50.370 --> 21:52.420
Well, I’d say, surely, that must be...

21:50.370 --> 21:52.420
Well, I’d say, surely, that must be...

21:52.580 --> 21:54.540
